BIC is based on a maximum likelihood estimate.  So you can't
use MCMC to find it.

One, increment_log_prob() doesn't return a value, and two,
you need to put it in the model block.  But you defined the
input for it as a transformed parameter, which will be visible
in the model block.

- Bob

