Hi Olive,

The error message has to do with line 86: increment_log_prob(poisson_log(dN[j,i], h0[i]*D[j,i]*exp(gama[1]*b[id[j],1]+ gama[2]*b[id[j],2]+gama[3]*b[id[j],3])));

The second argument to poisson_log, h0[i]*D[j,i]*exp(gama[1]*b[id[j],1]+ gama[2]*b[id[j],2]+gama[3]*b[id[j],3], is ending up negative; in your particular example, it was -73.6. There might be a bug in that expression or something that affects the calculation of the rate parameter for the poisson distribution.

Daniel

